  (async () => {
    for (let i = 1; i < data.images.length; i++) {
      // Upload each remaining image
      await uploadImageToDatabase(uri, recallData.id, 'image/jpeg');
    }
  })();
}
```

**Async Deletion (useNotes.ts)**:
